\par       \tab Every time I feel the Spirit moving in my heart,
\par \pard\li144\sl190\slmult0\qj  \tab I will pray. Every time I feel the Spirit
\par \tab moving in my heart I will pray.
\par 
\par \pard\li288\sl190\slmult0\cf1\ul\b\'b6 Verse 2\cf0\ulnone\b0 
\par \pard\li288\sl190\slmult0\qj     2. \tab Upon the mountain, when my Lord spoke, 
\par \pard\li144\sl190\slmult0\qj\tab Out of God's mouth came fire and smoke;
\par  \tab Look'd all around me.
\par 
\par \pard\sl190\slmult0\cf1\ul\b\'b6  Chorus\cf0\ulnone\b0 
\par                Every time I feel the Spirit moving in my heart,
\par \pard\li144\sl190\slmult0\qj  \tab I will pray. Every time I feel the Spirit
\par \tab moving in my heart I will pray.
\par 
\par \pard\li288\sl190\slmult0\cf1\ul\b\'b6  Verse 3\cf0\ulnone\b0 
\par    3.  \tab Oh, I have sorrows, and I have woes
\par \pard\li144\sl190\slmult0  \tab And I have heart- ache here below;
\par \tab But while God leads me I'll never fear
\par \pard\tab For, I am sheltered by God's care.
